        "text": "Base rate / reference class: over the latest 53 DOL weekly changes from July 26, 2025 through July 25, 2026, SA insured unemployment stayed mostly in a narrow band and the recent 2026 values clustered around 1.79-1.81 million. The same variant is used throughout: seasonally adjusted insured unemployment, not NSA state claims or all-program continued weeks claimed."
